          "lineage": "Prophysaon",
          "subspeciesCount": 0,
          "description": "Prophysaon coeruleum, (the blue-grey taildropper), is a species of slug belonging to the genus Prophysaon, a genus known for the autotomy of its tail.",
          "sourcedFrom": "gbif",
